The tour has 9 steps: home screen, orders, payment and documents, menu, inventory, customers, statistics, plans. You can repeat it in Settings → “App tour”.
To remove the sample data (only the samples are deleted, your own data is not touched):
— the “These are examples” banner on the home screen → “Delete”;
— at the end of the tour → “Delete examples”;
— Settings → “Delete Demo Data and Start Over” (visible to the owner only, while samples exist).
